  storyText: "Holocall: Kaz\n\nKaz's face flickers up. \"You got Nix's shard? Gonk! Every corp in this city wants it. Arasaka's offering 50,000 eb. Come to my garage. We'll make this right.\"\n\nHe sounds a little too happy.\n\n1. Go to Kaz's garage.\n2. \"Forget it, I'm out.\" Hang up."
